{"id": "EUVD-2026-76489", "enisaUuid": "2970a074-302a-32e9-b095-196a251afd3c", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndm-io: report non-retryable errors separatedly\n\nThe error codes BLK_STS_NOTSUPP and BLK_STS_INVAL should not cause leg\nfailure on dm-raid1. This patch changes the interface to dm-io, so that\nit reports two error bitmaps - error_bits and unsup_bits. The unsup_bit\nbitmap tracks BLK_STS_NOTSUPP or BLK_STS_INVAL errors, the error_bits\nbitmap tracks all the other errors.\n\ndm-raid1 is changed so that it won't fail a leg if it receives an error\nin the unsup_bits bitmap.\n\nThis patch (with 62dc37a819a5) fixes misbehavior if the user uses\nunaligned bio vectors on dm-raid1.", "datePublished": "2026-09-11T19:44:44", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T08:49:10", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/49694a363f7ecd5a52d1ea1a13c287ad6d196c35", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/15fc1ec72e1f8089063d298550ada727e18f114a", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/47a5e62f39875f371bded6e34ffb9cf15ccd813d"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-89577", "GHSA-fm7m-v5fw-6w27"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "00405a98-c35c-3c25-ada5-dee1dc4df1d4", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.50"}, {"id": "249fb145-5f54-3b95-8c75-873014d84621", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "46c8485d-e4ad-3498-b203-b6cb2c3b8904", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.18"}, {"id": "60e152ba-84aa-38a2-a645-ee5bb551e42d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "5ff3f74e145adc79b49668adb8de276446acf6be <49694a363f7ecd5a52d1ea1a13c287ad6d196c35"}, {"id": "b7a79a29-14f7-33d8-b0be-7f7fff5886d5", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "bc1607fd-aff5-319e-8bae-140a2e221e03", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "5ff3f74e145adc79b49668adb8de276446acf6be <47a5e62f39875f371bded6e34ffb9cf15ccd813d"}, {"id": "dbe36784-a480-3bd1-91f8-82a679c95973", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.4"}, {"id": "e157ab45-7f15-3ea9-bfa8-449b5b6b4532", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "5ff3f74e145adc79b49668adb8de276446acf6be <15fc1ec72e1f8089063d298550ada727e18f114a"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "35ff7abe-30f2-3eba-bda4-2a5c8212cc06", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}